# |correction| = |static_eval - raw_eval| (cp) at main-search nodes of the AL1 s198 search (CorrMargins off)

Method: scratch build of opus-O3 0d99f02 + correction_size_probe/instrumentation.diff (counters only; bench node
counts unchanged: d13 862329, d16 3024920, d20 12389307), PC recipe; bench 13 / 16 / 20 in fresh processes;
python correction_size_probe/analyze.py run_d13/hist_out.txt run_d16/hist_out.txt run_d20/hist_out.txt.
Bins of 2 cp; 'blocked fires' = prunes whose slack (eval - margin - beta, resp. alpha - futility value) is
smaller than the extra margin, i.e. the share of prunes a given weight would stop, estimated from the AL1 tree.
LMR rows: the whole-ply rule of Forge idea P7 (r -= 1 when |correction| >= T) versus O5's share rule
(r -= floor(r * |correction| * pct / 6400), pct 25 = the O5 default).

